  "title": "Why pay for scraping when this is free?",
  "description": "Crawl4AI is a free open source Python web crawler with 78,175 GitHub stars that turns any website into clean AI-ready text. It runs locally with no API key and no per-page fees, so it replaces the per-page billing of the paid scraping services for most jobs. Deep crawl an entire site section, or extract specific structured data like every price on a page. Includes install commands and working code for both AI-based and free selector-based extraction.\n\nGet the full setup here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CeUj43FyOwIEx6x0KEfiZnZ_MJeOAp_dUsj_pm8r1cY/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #WebScraping #OpenSource",
